{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>YHWH is your guardian</b> — from the enemy and from every illness, for He is your shade at your right hand. And he stated the reason of the shade by day. In two mems: יום without night. And it is known that the sun harms with its excessive heat, and the moon at night increases moisture that breeds diseases, and this matter is clear and tested."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 121, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:08.200029831Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}